      "text": "25.8.2026 ::My truth of yesterday : I, from Down Under live in Hilversum, took the train, at the station at 10.15 am, to go to Den Haag >> Austrlian Embas, {renew. Passport} bc.after to-morrow ; IT WILL BE EXPIRED. The trip (small  country), should not take more than 1 hour & 30 min. Arr. there at 11.55. I knew the address, but not to get there. Could not find a TAXI. S/body told me to take tram 17 & pointed into the direction ... wrong direction it went to the beach. I asked 12 ppl. how to get there. From diff. direction I ended up at the same building which is being  demolished. Nowhere could I see an Austr.flag. A guy standing at the door of *AN* Emb. did not underst. my question ; only SAID No No. I thank him for listenig .. he did not say NO NO ; Dutch National Police TRIED to help, &  pointed into the right direction, but did not offer me a RIDE, after 3 1/2 hrs of walking ; had to walk another 1 1/2 km. to get there, but my legs, feet & back gave up. Went home disgusted ; got home 20.20. hurting all over ; including wallet : costing € 45 + 1 day for noppes ; will try again to-morrow.!! [] PLS. Have a nice time in Holland, OR drown yourself in Tears. []",
